{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon encountering a mystical mirror, Ravenlok is whisked away to a whimsical world plagued by the sinister darkness of a tyrannical queen. Destiny awaits all in an unforgettable and heartfelt adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THRILLING ACTION ADVENTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against fearsome beasts and formidable monsters using real-time combat. Wield your sword and shield, and use the magical skills bestowed to you, along with an arsenal of bombs, to vanquish foes in epic boss encounters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072290/extras/11e223c88e8bf8b69b7a85a3bdd68e49.poster.avif?t=1747959333\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072290/extras/11e223c88e8bf8b69b7a85a3bdd68e49.webm?t=1747959333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072290/extras/11e223c88e8bf8b69b7a85a3bdd68e49.mp4?t=1747959333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENCHANTED WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet curious creatures and help them with their troubles to fight back against the encroaching darkness. Discover the whimsical Mushroom Forest, tackle puzzles in the Mask Mansion and unravel the mysteries of the Labyrinth in a wonderful world turned upside down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1072290/extras/32157330ebd6880683078a81143872ed.poster.avif?t=1747959333\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta